{"fps": 30, "frames": 1457, "beats": [{"a": 0, "b": 123, "text": "You'll sell your best stock, keep your worst, and feel smart doing it.", "words": [{"w": "You'll", "f": 8, "e": 17}, {"w": "sell", "f": 18, "e": 25}, {"w": "your", "f": 25, "e": 32}, {"w": "best", "f": 32, "e": 39}, {"w": "stock,", "f": 40, "e": 49}, {"w": "keep", "f": 50, "e": 57}, {"w": "your", "f": 57, "e": 64}, {"w": "worst,", "f": 65, "e": 74}, {"w": "and", "f": 75, "e": 80}, {"w": "feel", "f": 81, "e": 88}, {"w": "smart", "f": 88, "e": 96}, {"w": "doing", "f": 97, "e": 105}, {"w": "it.", "f": 106, "e": 111}]}, {"a": 123, "b": 317, "text": "In the nineties, an economist studied seven years of trades from ten thousand accounts at a discount broker.", "words": [{"w": "In", "f": 125, "e": 129}, {"w": "the", "f": 130, "e": 136}, {"w": "nineties,", "f": 137, "e": 153}, {"w": "an", "f": 154, "e": 158}, {"w": "economist", "f": 159, "e": 175}, {"w": "studied", "f": 176, "e": 189}, {"w": "seven", "f": 189, "e": 199}, {"w": "years", "f": 200, "e": 209}, {"w": "of", "f": 210, "e": 214}, {"w": "trades", "f": 215, "e": 226}, {"w": "from", "f": 227, "e": 235}, {"w": "ten", "f": 235, "e": 241}, {"w": "thousand", "f": 242, "e": 257}, {"w": "accounts", "f": 257, "e": 272}, {"w": "at", "f": 273, "e": 277}, {"w": "a", "f": 278, "e": 281}, {"w": "discount", "f": 281, "e": 296}, {"w": "broker.", "f": 296, "e": 309}]}, {"a": 317, "b": 424, "text": "Meet Gary. He owns a rocket that's up and a dud that's down.", "words": [{"w": "Meet", "f": 319, "e": 326}, {"w": "Gary.", "f": 327, "e": 336}, {"w": "He", "f": 337, "e": 341}, {"w": "owns", "f": 341, "e": 349}, {"w": "a", "f": 350, "e": 352}, {"w": "rocket", "f": 353, "e": 363}, {"w": "that's", "f": 364, "e": 375}, {"w": "up", "f": 375, "e": 380}, {"w": "and", "f": 380, "e": 386}, {"w": "a", "f": 387, "e": 389}, {"w": "dud", "f": 390, "e": 396}, {"w": "that's", "f": 396, "e": 407}, {"w": "down.", "f": 408, "e": 417}]}, {"a": 424, "b": 486, "text": "Gary needs cash. Which one goes?", "words": [{"w": "Gary", "f": 426, "e": 434}, {"w": "needs", "f": 434, "e": 443}, {"w": "cash.", "f": 444, "e": 453}, {"w": "Which", "f": 454, "e": 463}, {"w": "one", "f": 463, "e": 469}, {"w": "goes?", "f": 470, "e": 479}]}, {"a": 486, "b": 517, "text": "The rocket.", "words": [{"w": "The", "f": 488, "e": 495}, {"w": "rocket.", "f": 496, "e": 510}]}, {"a": 517, "b": 639, "text": "A stock that was up was over fifty percent more likely to be sold.", "words": [{"w": "A", "f": 519, "e": 522}, {"w": "stock", "f": 522, "e": 532}, {"w": "that", "f": 533, "e": 540}, {"w": "was", "f": 541, "e": 547}, {"w": "up", "f": 548, "e": 552}, {"w": "was", "f": 553, "e": 559}, {"w": "over", "f": 559, "e": 567}, {"w": "fifty", "f": 568, "e": 577}, {"w": "percent", "f": 578, "e": 591}, {"w": "more", "f": 591, "e": 599}, {"w": "likely", "f": 600, "e": 611}, {"w": "to", "f": 612, "e": 616}, {"w": "be", "f": 617, "e": 621}, {"w": "sold.", "f": 622, "e": 631}]}, {"a": 639, "b": 707, "text": "So why dump the winner and hug the loser?", "words": [{"w": "So", "f": 641, "e": 644}, {"w": "why", "f": 645, "e": 650}, {"w": "dump", "f": 650, "e": 657}, {"w": "the", "f": 658, "e": 663}, {"w": "winner", "f": 663, "e": 673}, {"w": "and", "f": 673, "e": 678}, {"w": "hug", "f": 679, "e": 684}, {"w": "the", "f": 685, "e": 690}, {"w": "loser?", "f": 690, "e": 699}]}, {"a": 707, "b": 811, "text": "Worse, the winners they sold kept beating the losers they kept.", "words": [{"w": "Worse,", "f": 709, "e": 719}, {"w": "the", "f": 719, "e": 725}, {"w": "winners", "f": 725, "e": 737}, {"w": "they", "f": 737, "e": 744}, {"w": "sold", "f": 745, "e": 751}, {"w": "kept", "f": 752, "e": 759}, {"w": "beating", "f": 759, "e": 771}, {"w": "the", "f": 771, "e": 777}, {"w": "losers", "f": 777, "e": 787}, {"w": "they", "f": 788, "e": 795}, {"w": "kept.", "f": 795, "e": 803}]}, {"a": 811, "b": 942, "text": "You see, it's like a late bus. The longer you wait, the harder it is to leave.", "words": [{"w": "You", "f":